rokeColor": "#495057", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "etats.jpg (recadr\u00e9, 60 %) : survol de Change, du bouton et de Cancel Order", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895222958, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1639744236, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "os-1a-tab", "type": "rectangle", "x": 71480, "y": 210, "width": 1000, "height": 580, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jm", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 673851726, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793895222958, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 432687418}, {"id": "os-1a-tab-t", "type": "text", "x": 71504, "y": 230, "width": 165, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jn", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Mesures desktop", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1558580225, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Mesures desktop", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895222958, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2082500771, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "os-1a-tab-b", "type": "text", "x": 71504, "y": 274, "width": 952, "height": 340, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jo", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Fond Blue 100, motif en vague en haut (pattern-background-desktop.svg 1440 \u00d7 437).\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 450 \u00d7 697 centr\u00e9e (x 495, y 102), rayon 20, blanche, grande ombre bleut\u00e9e.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Illustration 450 \u00d7 220 en haut, coins du haut arrondis comme la carte.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Order Summary \u00bb 28 px 900 Blue 950, centr\u00e9, encre \u00e0 53 sous l'illustration ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0paragraphe 16 px 500 Gray 600, centr\u00e9, 3 lignes de 26 px.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Encadr\u00e9 du forfait 354 \u00d7 98 (x 543, y 519), rayon 10, Blue 50 ; ic\u00f4ne 48 px \u00e0\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a024 du bord ; \u00ab Annual Plan \u00bb 16 px 900 Blue 950 ; \u00ab $59.99/year \u00bb 16 px 500\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Gray 600 ; \u00ab Change \u00bb 14 px 700 Blue 700 soulign\u00e9, \u00e0 24 du bord droit.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Proceed to Payment \u00bb 354 \u00d7 48 (y 651), rayon 10, Blue 700, 15 px 900 blanc,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0ombre Blue 700 diffuse.\n6\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Cancel Order \u00bb 15 px 900 Gray 600, centr\u00e9, 38 sous le bouton ; 53 en bas.\n\nSurvols (etats.jpg) : Change plus clair et sans soulignement ; bouton plus clair\n(#766CF1) ; Cancel Order en Blue 950.\nTailles cal\u00e9es : titre 28 \u00b7 texte 16 \u00b7 forfait 16 \u00b7 Change 14 \u00b7 bouton et Cancel 15\n(\u2264 2 %, paragraphe 3,6 %).", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 223235277, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Fond Blue 100, motif en vague en haut (pattern-background-desktop.svg 1440 \u00d7 437).\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 450 \u00d7 697 centr\u00e9e (x 495, y 102), rayon 20, blanche, grande ombre bleut\u00e9e.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Illustration 450 \u00d7 220 en haut, coins du haut arrondis comme la carte.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Order Summary \u00bb 28 px 900 Blue 950, centr\u00e9, encre \u00e0 53 sous l'illustration ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0paragraphe 16 px 500 Gray 600, centr\u00e9, 3 lignes de 26 px.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Encadr\u00e9 du forfait 354 \u00d7 98 (x 543, 