"roundness": null, "seed": 860259025, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2B \u00b7 Contrastes (AA : 4,5:1 texte)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895222959, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1517341301, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "os-2b-b", "type": "text", "x": 71264, "y": 2123, "width": 1192, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 16, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0kC", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : Gray 600 sur blanc 3,92:1 (paragraphe, Cancel Order) et\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0sur Blue 50 3,66:1 (prix) (Q-A1).\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : survols de FM \u2014 blanc sur le bouton clair (#766CF1) 4,05:1,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Change \u00bb clair sur Blue 50 \u2248 4,0:1 (Q-A2).\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : titre et forfait Blue 950 13,13:1 ; Change Blue 700 7,66:1 ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0bouton blanc sur Blue 700 8,20:1 ; attribution #3E52A3 5,83:1 sur Blue 100.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Illustration, ic\u00f4ne et motif : d\u00e9coratifs.", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1209819837, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : Gray 600 sur blanc 3,92:1 (paragraphe, Cancel Order) et\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0sur Blue 50 3,66:1 (prix) (Q-A1).\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : survols de FM \u2014 blanc sur le bouton clair (#766CF1) 4,05:1,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Change \u00bb clair sur Blue 50 \u2248 4,0:1 (Q-A2).\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : titre et forfait Blue 950 13,13:1 ; Change Blue 700 7,66:1 ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0bouton blanc sur Blue 700 8,20:1 ; attribution #3E52A3 5,83:1 sur Blue 100.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Illustration, ic\u00f4ne et motif : d\u00e9coratifs.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895222959, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 942808649, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "os-2d-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 69980, "y": 2319, "width": 2520, "height": 270, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0kD", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 98275488, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "updated": 1793895222959, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1659585596}, {"id": "os-2d-t", "type": "text", "x": 70000, "y": 2339, "width": 748, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0kE", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1442061163, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895222959, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 766579781, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "os-2d-b", "type": "text", "x": 70000, "y": 2383, "width": 2480, "height": 148.75, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0kF", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Q-A1\u00a0\u00a0Gray 600 sous 4,5:1. (Gris plus fonc\u00e9, m\u00eame teinte : hsl(224, 23%, 46%), 5,44:1 sur blanc et 5,09:1 sur Blue 50, pour le paragraphe, le prix et Cancel Order.)\nQ-A2\u00a0\u00a0Survols de FM sous 4,5:1. (M\u00eame id\u00e9e \u00ab plus clair \u00bb, mais AA : hsl(245, 75%, 62%) pour le bouton (blanc dessus 5,29:1) et pour Change (4,94:1 sur Blue 50).)\nQ-B1\u00a0\u00a0Change, Proceed to Payment et Cancel Order n'ont pas de destination. (button type=\"button\" sans action, comme Continue au lot 1 ; Change garde l'aspect d'un lien.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Illustration et ic\u00f4ne. (D\u00e9coratives, alt=\"\" : le texte dit tout.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (Carte de 450 px centr\u00e9e d\u00e8s 480 px ; en dessous, la carte mobile \u00e0 24 px des bords.)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Attribution. (Gard\u00e9e sous la carte comme au lot 1 : 11 px, liens #3E52A3, survol sans soulignement, focus 2 px.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0Refonte. (M\u00eame d\u00e9p\u00f4t front-ui-order en v2.0.0, historique gard\u00e9 ; GitHub Pages ; \u00ab Edit solution \u00bb sur FM.)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 2077858771, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Q-A1\u00a0\u00a0Gray 600 sous 4,5:1. (Gris plus fonc\u00e9, m\u00eame teinte : hsl(224, 23%, 46%), 5,44:1 sur blanc et 5,09:1 sur Blue 50, pour le paragraphe, le prix et Cancel Order.)\nQ-A2\u00a0\u00a0Survols de FM sous 4,5:1. (M\u00eame id\u00e9e \u00ab plus clair \u00bb, mais AA : hsl(245, 75%, 62%) pour le bouton (blanc dessus 5,29:1) et pour Change (4,94:1 sur Blue 50).)\nQ-B1\u00a0\u00a0Change, Proceed to Payment et Cancel Order n'ont pas de destination. (button type=\"button\" sans action, comme Continue au lot 1 ; Change garde l'aspect d'un lien.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Illustration et ic\u00f4ne. (D\u00e9coratives, alt=\"\" : le texte dit tout.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (Carte de 450 px centr\u00e9e d\u00e8s 480 px ; en dessous, la carte mobile \u00e0 24 px des bords.)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Attribution. (Gard\u00e9e sous la carte comme au lot 1 : 11 px, liens #3E52A3, survol sans soulignement, focus 2 px.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0Refonte. (M\u00eame d\u00e9p\u00f4t front-ui-order en v2.0.0, historique gard\u00e9 ; GitHub Pages ; \u00ab Edit solution \u00bb sur FM.)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895222959, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1602385415, "verticalAlign": "top"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {"os-img-d-file": {"id": "os-img-d-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793895177433}, "os-img-e-file": {"id": "os-img-e-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793895177433}, "os-img-m-file": {"id": "os-img-m-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793895177433}}}